      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DON'T TELL DANNI (1) turned in a solid run last start over 525m at The Meadows finishing 5th and beaten only 3.5 lengths (30.88). Solid record here at the distance winning two races. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and three minor placings to her credit. Should be very hard to beat this time. KRAKEN BABE (7) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at Shepparton over 450m behind Deal 'Em High (26.24) in a Rank Limit - Grade 5. Should be thereabouts. BLACKBERRY JUICE (3) finds it hard to win but looks close to breaking through. Has finished in the placings two on end now, the latest when third (28.79) at this track. Has a good record at this journey. Expected to be in the finish again. REMI JOY (6) is a last-start placegetter who is in the mix again.",
